---
kind: lore
id: home
title: Home screen taps
---

/* Each hero's once-a-day line lives in their own file. After it, taps fall
   to these roster-wide lines. */

<beat id="festivalTap" on="homeTap" target="kind:hero" once="false" priority="-1" when="@anyEventLive">
  @narrator: {{occasion.target}} is wearing a paper festival crown. Somebody made it badly, with love.
</beat>

<beat id="idleTap" on="homeTap" target="kind:hero" once="false" priority="-2">
  @narrator: {{occasion.target}} waves back.
</beat>

<beat id="lateTap" on="homeTap" target="kind:hero" once="slot" priority="-1" when="@weekend && !@anyEventLive">
  @narrator: {{occasion.target}} is asleep on the couch. It's the weekend, after all.
</beat>

/* Bond tab, Story button, when the hero has no story ready: how far the
   next rank is (the roster's rule table: 100 / 300 / 600). */
<beat id="bondNotYet" on="bondStory" target="kind:hero" once="false" priority="-10">
  @narrator: {{occasion.target}} smiles, but doesn't say anything else yet. Spend more time together.
  @narrator{when="!holds(bondRank(occasion.target, r1))"}: Bond {{user.bond[occasion.target]}} of 100 to the first story.
  @narrator{when="holds(bondRank(occasion.target, r1)) && !holds(bondRank(occasion.target, r2))"}: Bond {{user.bond[occasion.target]}} of 300 to the next story.
  @narrator{when="holds(bondRank(occasion.target, r2)) && !holds(bondRank(occasion.target, r3))"}: Bond {{user.bond[occasion.target]}} of 600 to the last story.
</beat>
